      <trans-unit id="2643619752875482378" datatype="html">
        <source> Beyond the web, I have always kept several passions going at the same time. This site presents three of them, deliberately different, to illustrate the <x id="START_TAG_STRONG" ctype="x-strong" equiv-text="&lt;strong&gt;"/>variety<x id="CLOSE_TAG_STRONG" ctype="x-strong" equiv-text="&lt;/strong&gt;"/> of my interests. You will find <x id="START_TAG_STRONG" ctype="x-strong" equiv-text="&lt;strong&gt;"/>FPV flying<x id="CLOSE_TAG_STRONG" ctype="x-strong" equiv-text="&lt;/strong&gt;"/>, <x id="START_TAG_STRONG" ctype="x-strong" equiv-text="&lt;strong&gt;"/>tennis<x id="CLOSE_TAG_STRONG" ctype="x-strong" equiv-text="&lt;/strong&gt;"/> and <x id="START_TAG_STRONG" ctype="x-strong" equiv-text="&lt;strong&gt;"/>Age of Mythology<x id="CLOSE_TAG_STRONG" ctype="x-strong" equiv-text="&lt;/strong&gt;"/>, in other words a bit of tech, a bit of sport and a bit of strategy. Choose a topic below to learn more. </source>
